<%= render 'details' %>
<% if @change_kind == 'cancelled' %>
This event has been cancelled<% if @occurrence.cancellation_reason.present? %>: <%= @occurrence.cancellation_reason %><% end %>.
Your RSVP is cancelled and will not be restored if the event is reactivated.
<% elsif @change_kind == 'postponed' %>
This event has been postponed<% if @event.postponed_until.present? %> until <%= @event.postponed_until.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %><% end %><% if @event.cancellation_reason.present? %>: <%= @event.cancellation_reason %><% end %>.
Your RSVP is still on file for the original date.
<% elsif @change_kind == 'relocated' %>
This event has moved to <%= @occurrence.relocated_to %>.
<% else %>
The date or time has changed. Your RSVP still stands, and the same link works.
<% end %>
